# Flovira project instructions

Read [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) and applicable module instructions before editing. They are the primary source for architecture, Java compatibility, contracts, migrations, verification, licensing and git authorization. This summary adds no independent rules.

Flovira uses Gradle for backend modules and Bun for separate Vue / React designer packages. Core remains framework-, ORM- and JSON-independent. Supported database baselines are MySQL, PostgreSQL and Oracle. Schemas do not use foreign keys; every table defines non-null `deleted` with default `0`, and indexes follow tenant and logical-deletion query predicates. Forms belong to the host application and are referenced by string `formId`.
